			(value "Pico 2 H")
			(footprint "OSC_Shared:RPi_Pico_TH_Headers")
			(description "Four-button module MCU (Raspberry Pi Pico 2 H on 2.54mm headers, floating ~2.5mm; 40 header pins only, hub decision 2026-09-30). GP2-5=button inputs (shared between grid and diamond sockets, only one set populated at a time). GP6=NeoPixel data (SK6812 x4 daisy-chained via R10, unused in grid/keypad mode). GP7-9=spare/unused (freed up by the 2026-10-01 NeoPixel switch, previously LEDDRV_B/G/Y). GP10=status LED. GP11=mode-select switch.")
			(fields
